      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHINE OVER ME (2) ran below best last time finishing fifth (17.82) over 300m at this track from Box 5. Has a strong record from box 2, including two wins. Has winning claims on her best figures. ZERO SURF (1) first look at this trip and drops in distance on last start. Should get a good run from the inside box. Looks one of the chances. ORANA JET (4) jumped from a low draw and boxed on well to finish third last time, beaten 0.8 lengths (17.47) behind Mr Flame at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from five starts. Expected to be in the finish again. DODGY WILLOW (5) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a Novice race at this track over 300m.",
